                    "Continuous Threat Intelligence Sharing & ISAC Integration establishes collaborative enterprise immunity. Every quarantined payload and novel jailbreak pattern detected by the gateway is cryptographically anonymized and shared with industry bodies—such as the Financial Services Information Sharing and Analysis Center (FS-ISAC) and MITRE ATLAS (Adversarial Threat Landscape for Artificial-Intelligence Systems). By participating in federated threat intelligence exchanges, the enterprise automatically imports real-time indicators of compromise (IoCs) and emerging attack vectors identified across peer corporate networks, neutralizing global adversarial campaigns before they reach local corporate boundaries.",
